   "language": "english",
   "review": "Mr HappyFunFace is a time based horror game where you have 60 seconds to find the keys you need and get to the exit. \n\nLikes:  Fast paced gameplay\nGood sound design and graphics\nLots of notes to find as you try to escape\nSome really creepy events can happen\n2 endings. and 3(?) different starting points / key placements\n\nDislikes: Instant kill mechanics for looking at something, so you spend a lot of time looking at the floor\nVery simple gameplay loop. Once you learn the placement of the keys you can beat it very quickly.\n\nOverall I really enjoyed my time with this game, and I can see speedrunners really enjoying this as well.",
   "timestamp_created": 1763651036,
