   "language": "english",
   "review": "This game was EXTREMELY underrated. It may seem unpolished but GOD was it good, I've only played the first level so far and I'm absolutely blown away by the mechanics, the subtle and changing jumpscares, and the difficulty being scaled perfectly, where it may seem \"repetitive\" but theres so much lore to uncover that you have enough to keep you 'stimulated' without being bored of it\n\nI streamed it live on twitch and my viewers all agreed that it's an absolute banger!\nHere's my first reactions of it https://youtu.be/5M4cRR0-_mI",
